{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56245","headline":"判神奇军背军官健李绍妻阿邓乞改嫁 · 宋光嗣","name":"判神奇军背军官健李绍妻阿邓乞改嫁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淡红衫子赤辉辉，不抹燕，不画眉，未壻背军缘甚事，女人别嫁欲何爲。\n孤儿携去君争忍，抵子归来我不知。\n若有支持且须守，口中争着两把匙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋光嗣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}